#  SECTION 18 -- DATA BUILDER
#
#  build_data() assembles the full JSON payload for the SPA dashboard.
#  It is cached with TTL and invalidated on every successful DB flush.
#
#  enrich_live() injects fields that are not in the DB:
#    - net.iface, net.ssid, net.signal_dbm, net.all_ifaces
#    - disk.total_gb, disk.free_gb, disk.partitions
